<ServicePage title="Mount St Mary Leeds: RubberBond Roofing | WW Roofing" description="WW Roofing’s 953 m² RubberBond FleeceBack EPDM installation at Mount St Mary, Richmond Hill, Leeds. Completed May 2025 for S9 Construction." kicker="Featured project / Richmond Hill, Leeds" heading="Mount St Mary. A specialist flat roofing package." intro="953 m² of RubberBond FleeceBack EPDM, installed by WW Roofing as part of the wider redevelopment of this Grade II listed Leeds landmark.">
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><img src="/images/mount-st-mary-2.webp" width="1536" height="866" alt="Aerial view of the completed EPDM flat roofing at Mount St Mary" fetchpriority="high"/><div class="content-grid" style="margin-top:50px"><div class="editorial"><h2>Our part in the project</h2><p>WW completed the flat roofing installation within a larger restoration and residential development. The build-up used RubberBond FleeceBack EPDM, an air and vapour control layer (AVCL) and tapered insulation over a timber deck.</p><h2>Care at the junctions</h2><p>Box gutters, parapets, corners and interfaces with pitched roofs called for carefully sequenced detailing. Flex-R’s technical team visited before installation to advise on the more demanding junctions.</p><h2>A coordinated installation</h2><p>Flex-R records three RubberBond-trained WW operatives carrying out the work, supported by labourers handling materials. Our role was the roofing installation; S9 Construction led the wider development, designed by Den Architecture.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://flex-r.co.uk/case-study/mount-st-mary/">Read Flex-R’s published case study ↗</a><h2>What this means for your roof</h2><p>Drainage, preparation and careful detailing matter on every scale. Those principles also inform our work on smaller roofs.</p><div class="page-links"><a href="/flat-roofing/">RubberBond flat roofing</a><a href="/sectors/commercial/">Commercial roofing</a><a href="/about/">About WW</a></div></div><aside class="aside-panel"><h2>Project details</h2><dl class="fact-list"><dt>Location</dt><dd>Richmond Hill, Leeds</dd><dt>Flat roof area</dt><dd>953 m²</dd><dt>System</dt><dd>RubberBond FleeceBack EPDM</dd><dt>Build-up</dt><dd>AVCL & tapered insulation</dd><dt>Completed</dt><dd>May 2025</dd><dt>Roofing installer</dt><dd>WW Roofing</dd><dt>Main contractor</dt><dd>S9 Construction</dd><dt>Architect</dt><dd>Den Architecture</dd></dl></aside></div><div class="project-gallery"><img src="/images/mount-st-mary-1.webp" width="1536" height="866" alt="Flat roof areas with adjoining pitched elements at Mount St Mary" loading="lazy"/><img src="/images/mount-st-mary-3.webp" width="1536" height="866" alt="Membrane, perimeter and rooflight interfaces at Mount St Mary" loading="lazy"/></div><p style="font-size:12px;margin-top:15px">Project photographs from Flex-R’s published case study, reused with permission confirmed by WW.</p></div></section>
